WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.179 --> 00:00:04.020
SCP-682 Vs a Ton of Liquid Nitrogen.

00:00:04.020 --> 00:00:09.480
After trying and failing to kill SCP-682 via
anomalous means, Dr. Carlson wished to return

00:00:09.480 --> 00:00:14.350
to basics and try some non-anomalous murder
methods for bringing an end to this nasty

00:00:14.350 --> 00:00:15.350
lizard.

00:00:15.350 --> 00:00:17.570
The 682 tissue sample was successful.

00:00:17.570 --> 00:00:21.700
It was frozen and shattered when struck with
a hammer, exactly as intended.

00:00:21.700 --> 00:00:27.600
However, when 682-proper was doused with liquid
nitrogen, its body remained frozen and dormant…

00:00:27.600 --> 00:00:28.730
For about ten minutes.

00:00:28.730 --> 00:00:32.760
Then, it began increasing its body temperature
until it was thawed.

00:00:32.760 --> 00:00:34.530
But it didn’t stop there.

00:00:34.530 --> 00:00:38.970
It kept increasing its body temperature until
it was so hot that the walls of its containment

00:00:38.970 --> 00:00:40.430
chamber began to melt.

00:00:40.430 --> 00:00:45.829
Dr. Carlson noted, “Interesting, it retained
the adaption even after it was no longer necessary.

00:00:45.829 --> 00:00:47.410
Maybe we should be more careful.”

00:00:47.410 --> 00:00:51.469
SCP-682 Vs SCP-294.

00:00:51.469 --> 00:00:54.570
The Hard to Destroy Reptile Vs The Coffee
Machine.

00:00:54.570 --> 00:00:59.280
Could this supernatural Keurig brew up a final
victory over this ornery reptile?

00:00:59.280 --> 00:01:05.000
Researchers got the machine to dispense “SCP-682
Killer”, and poured it onto a tissue sample.

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:09.650
The sample crumbled into a fine powder when
it made contact with the liquid, so they cumulatively

00:01:09.650 --> 00:01:14.530
brewed up a liter of the stuff, and poured
it onto the actual SCP-682.

00:01:14.530 --> 00:01:19.330
The affected areas decayed and crumbled just
like in the test, and when 682 was placed

00:01:19.330 --> 00:01:22.780
back into its acid tank, the areas completely
dissolved.

00:01:22.780 --> 00:01:27.729
The researchers felt incredibly hopeful, believing
that if a large enough quantity of SCP-682

00:01:27.729 --> 00:01:30.900
Killer can be synthesized, it may actually
live up to its name.

00:01:30.900 --> 00:01:35.200
We’ll let you know as soon as they try it
again with a venti order.

00:01:35.200 --> 00:01:38.509
SCP-682 Vs SCP-923.

00:01:38.509 --> 00:01:43.540
Can this terrifying, mind-melting satellite
finally drive SCP-682 off the edge?

00:01:43.540 --> 00:01:48.829
Foundation researchers damaged 682 heavily
and took it out to an isolated field in Kansas

00:01:48.829 --> 00:01:51.000
in order to find out.

00:01:51.000 --> 00:01:57.360
SCP-923 fired down at 682 with its beam set
to Intensity level 75, known to have devastating

00:01:57.360 --> 00:01:59.900
effects against the minds of its victims.

00:01:59.900 --> 00:02:05.340
When the blast was unleashed, 682 began screaming
and howling obscenities at the sky and the

00:02:05.340 --> 00:02:06.340
Foundation.

00:02:06.340 --> 00:02:11.680
Then, its body began to adapt, growing glowing
nodes that fired out its own beams similar

00:02:11.680 --> 00:02:18.260
to 923’s blasts, driving the observing Foundation
employees completely insane.

00:02:18.260 --> 00:02:23.629
The test was considered such a failure that
one of the lead researchers on the SCP-682

00:02:23.629 --> 00:02:29.150
termination project threatened to do something
REDACTED to whoever organized it.

00:02:29.150 --> 00:02:32.519
SCP-682 Vs Extremely High Temperatures.

00:02:32.519 --> 00:02:36.519
Could the monstrous Hard to Destroy Reptile
finally be roasted to death in a super-heated

00:02:36.519 --> 00:02:37.519
room?

00:02:37.519 --> 00:02:39.840
The researchers at the SCP Foundation hoped
so.

00:02:39.840 --> 00:02:44.980
They locked it in a special chamber and increased
the temperature to truly immense proportions,

00:02:44.980 --> 00:02:49.769
but rather than melting, as the researchers
had hoped, it developed a carapace of solid

00:02:49.769 --> 00:02:52.189
helium, which defended it from the heat.

00:02:52.189 --> 00:02:56.159
Even worse was that the carapace remained
in place, even as the room was reduced back

00:02:56.159 --> 00:02:57.749
to safe temperatures.

00:02:57.749 --> 00:03:01.569
When personnel were sent in to inspect the
creature, the carapace abruptly shattered

00:03:01.569 --> 00:03:05.459
and exploded all over the room, shredding
everyone nearby.

00:03:05.459 --> 00:03:12.180
682 had baited its victims inside, and gotten
a little payback for the extreme sauna session.

00:03:12.180 --> 00:03:15.689
SCP-682 versus SCP-3922.

00:03:15.689 --> 00:03:19.900
Who would win in this matchup between the
indestructible reptile and the TV reality

00:03:19.900 --> 00:03:20.900
filter?

00:03:20.900 --> 00:03:25.159
3922 is a small cylinder that, when placed
near a television, will alter the content

00:03:25.159 --> 00:03:29.379
of any fictional material being played to
include a battalion of heavily armored soldiers

00:03:29.379 --> 00:03:33.209
who proceed to arrest the characters in the
film and try them for their crimes.

00:03:33.209 --> 00:03:37.310
The Foundation introduced 3922 to security
footage of 682.

00:03:37.310 --> 00:03:42.341
The tape was then altered into a 72-hour military
epic in which a coalition of soldiers, all

00:03:42.341 --> 00:03:47.019
played by deceased actors, attempted to terminate
682 over the course of the film.

00:03:47.019 --> 00:03:51.090
The film ends with a final remaining soldier,
played by Patrick Swayze, alongside several

00:03:51.090 --> 00:03:56.239
gigantic primates staring down 682 and preparing
to duke it out once and for all before…

00:03:56.239 --> 00:03:59.169
a TO BE CONTINUED title card is displayed!

00:03:59.169 --> 00:04:01.689
Talk about a sequel hook.

00:04:01.689 --> 00:04:04.779
SCP-682 Vs SCP-117.

00:04:04.779 --> 00:04:08.260
The Hard to Destroy Reptile Vs The Perfect
Multi-Tool.

00:04:08.260 --> 00:04:12.409
But can this ultra-convenient and somewhat
vampiric gadget finally MacGuyver this nasty

00:04:12.409 --> 00:04:13.900
lizard out of existence?

00:04:13.900 --> 00:04:18.759
The Foundation started with a sample test,
using tissue extracted from 682’s back and

00:04:18.759 --> 00:04:21.280
a D-Class in charge of holding the multitool.

00:04:21.280 --> 00:04:22.690
The test looked promising.

00:04:22.690 --> 00:04:28.050
117 produced a number of pneumatic hammers
and pounded the 682 tissue sample into a fine

00:04:28.050 --> 00:04:32.370
slurry, then disintegrated this slurry into
nothingness with particle beam weaponry - leaving

00:04:32.370 --> 00:04:36.639
the D-Class it was being handled by, with
an almost deadly mineral deficiency.

00:04:36.639 --> 00:04:42.669
However, as you can probably guess, the test
against the whole 682 lizard wasn’t so successful.

00:04:42.669 --> 00:04:48.129
Rather than attacking 682, 117 produced a
device that teleported itself and the D-Class

00:04:48.129 --> 00:04:50.250
using it away, killing the D-Class in the
process.

00:04:50.250 --> 00:04:52.480
Test failed.

00:04:52.480 --> 00:04:56.310
SCP-682 Vs SCP-170.

00:04:56.310 --> 00:05:00.970
Can the ultimate molecular superglue pin the
Hard to Destroy Reptile down for good?

00:05:00.970 --> 00:05:06.139
The SCP-170 glue was laced onto a series of
metal chains, with the hope of confining rather

00:05:06.139 --> 00:05:08.090
than executing the monster.

00:05:08.090 --> 00:05:11.710
The tissue sample was promising, and things
proceeded from there.

00:05:11.710 --> 00:05:15.780
682 was sedated and wrapped with chains which
were then connected to the ground.

00:05:15.780 --> 00:05:19.819
Initially, when 682 woke up, it thrashed around
and tried to escape.

00:05:19.819 --> 00:05:22.159
However, its attempts were futile.

00:05:22.159 --> 00:05:26.630
But before the researchers could start patting
themselves on the back, 682 began to grow,

00:05:26.630 --> 00:05:30.259
until it reached such a size that the chains
simply popped off.

00:05:30.259 --> 00:05:34.849
The leading theory as to how this worked was
that it hadn’t technically grown, but increased

00:05:34.849 --> 00:05:41.250
the distance between its particles, shattering
the molecular bond created by SCP-170.

00:05:41.250 --> 00:05:45.300
SCP-682 Vs SCP-049.

00:05:45.300 --> 00:05:49.710
The Hard to Destroy Reptile is certainly a
pretty pestilent creature, but would the mild-mannered

00:05:49.710 --> 00:05:53.169
Plague Doctor be able to cure our world of
its presence?

00:05:53.169 --> 00:05:58.449
SCP-049 slowly approached the creature, seeming
equal parts fascinated and frightened.

00:05:58.449 --> 00:06:03.979
It murmured, “The disease appears to not
affect only humans…” to itself.

00:06:03.979 --> 00:06:08.639
It closed in to get a better look and tried
to grab 682, but the reptile immediately growled

00:06:08.639 --> 00:06:10.520
and swiped at 049.

00:06:10.520 --> 00:06:15.259
The doctor narrowly dodged taking any real
damage, but the experience shook him.

00:06:15.259 --> 00:06:18.889
He seemed panicked and a little emotionally
disturbed.

00:06:18.889 --> 00:06:22.499
At his own request, he was escorted back to
his containment chamber.

00:06:22.499 --> 00:06:24.219
Poor guy.

00:06:24.219 --> 00:06:27.350
SCP-682 Vs SCP-2855.

00:06:27.350 --> 00:06:32.620
They say that money makes the world go round,
but can Mr. Money put the reptile underground?

00:06:32.620 --> 00:06:37.780
SCP-2855, or Mr. Money, is part of Dr. Wondertainment’s
Little Misters series.

00:06:37.780 --> 00:06:42.290
His ability is having whatever capabilities
his buyer believes he has, so he was sold

00:06:42.290 --> 00:06:48.439
to a member of the O5 Council as “A man
who can permanently destroy SCP-682, and will

00:06:48.439 --> 00:06:51.490
do so immediately upon completion of this
transaction.”

00:06:51.490 --> 00:06:53.710
However, this didn’t happen.

00:06:53.710 --> 00:06:59.520
Instead, he disappeared for an hour, during
which time SCP-682 seemed to show no ill effects.

00:06:59.520 --> 00:07:03.719
He later reappeared next to the Council Member,
dazed and experiencing memory loss, with a

00:07:03.719 --> 00:07:04.800
note that read:

00:07:04.800 --> 00:07:05.800
“Oops!

00:07:05.800 --> 00:07:09.840
Dr. Wondertainment offers the sincerest of
apologies for the unanticipated malfunction

00:07:09.840 --> 00:07:11.990
of your Mr. MoneyTM.

00:07:11.990 --> 00:07:15.430
We will be working to correct this error in
future products.”

00:07:15.430 --> 00:07:20.249
SCP-682 Vs SCP-093.

00:07:20.249 --> 00:07:24.280
Our dimension can’t seem to keep the Hard
to Destroy Reptile down, but maybe the dimension

00:07:24.280 --> 00:07:29.969
that SCP-093, the Red Sea Object, offers us
access to across the mirror plane might have

00:07:29.969 --> 00:07:30.969
better luck?

00:07:30.969 --> 00:07:35.659
The object passed around SCP-682 until it
turned green and affixed itself to a nearby

00:07:35.659 --> 00:07:38.759
mirror, purposefully selected to be big enough
to allow SCP-682 through.

00:07:38.759 --> 00:07:45.210
When it refused to enter, the mirror was brought
over, 682 was pushed in, and then the mirror

00:07:45.210 --> 00:07:46.210
was shattered.

00:07:46.210 --> 00:07:51.520
However, later on, the mirror anomalously
put itself back together and SCP-682 was pushed

00:07:51.520 --> 00:07:54.710
back out - Because of course he was.

00:07:54.710 --> 00:07:58.210
SCP-682 commented, of his time on the other
side:

00:07:58.210 --> 00:08:01.810
“'I am not very amused.”

00:08:01.810 --> 00:08:04.870
SCP-682 VS SCP-5871.

00:08:04.870 --> 00:08:08.580
Could the knife that retroactively erases
its victims from the timeline finally remove

00:08:08.580 --> 00:08:12.469
the Hard to Destroy Reptile from our past,
present, and future?

00:08:12.469 --> 00:08:17.210
SCP-682 was bound in place by restraints to
prevent it from escaping and a researcher

00:08:17.210 --> 00:08:22.080
using SCP-5871 slashed it, erasing it from
existence.

00:08:22.080 --> 00:08:27.270
From that point on, a CK-Class Reality Restructuring
Event occurred, and post-restructure researchers

00:08:27.270 --> 00:08:30.219
were unable to find any traces of SCP-682.

00:08:30.219 --> 00:08:33.240
It seemed almost like it never existed.

00:08:33.240 --> 00:08:38.729
However, soon after this, the effects were
reversed by SCP-682’s adapting abilities.

00:08:38.729 --> 00:08:43.529
682 returned to reality, then the test we
just described was erased from existence - as

00:08:43.529 --> 00:08:47.430
well as SCP-5871.

00:08:47.430 --> 00:08:50.220
SCP-682 Vs SCP-101.

00:08:50.220 --> 00:08:54.089
Could the Hungry Bag finally be the anomaly
that doesn’t find the Hard to Destroy Reptile

00:08:54.089 --> 00:08:55.980
too tough to swallow?

00:08:55.980 --> 00:09:01.779
SCP-101, the Hungry Bag, is a small, tooth-lined
bag seemingly connected to a limitless pocket

00:09:01.779 --> 00:09:04.630
dimension, capable of devouring almost anything.

00:09:04.630 --> 00:09:10.480
Dr. Lee Roy Carlson suggested it might be
perfect to finish off 682 after it was reduced

00:09:10.480 --> 00:09:12.530
in size by another anomaly.

00:09:12.530 --> 00:09:19.910
So after SCP-682 was shrunk down by a confrontation
with SCP-165-1, its tiny body was thrown into

00:09:19.910 --> 00:09:23.760
the gaping maw of SCP-101, and swallowed up.

00:09:23.760 --> 00:09:28.269
Later, however, SCP-101 began to gurgle for
an extended period.

00:09:28.269 --> 00:09:34.050
After a prolonged period of discomfort, it
belched up the tiny SCP-682, which later returned

00:09:34.050 --> 00:09:36.230
to its normal size.

00:09:36.230 --> 00:09:39.520
SCP-682 VS SCP-3042.

00:09:39.520 --> 00:09:44.230
Could the ultimate case of Puppy Love be the
force to counteract SCP-682’s reptilian

00:09:44.230 --> 00:09:45.230
hatred?

00:09:45.230 --> 00:09:46.720
Let’s take a look and see.

00:09:46.720 --> 00:09:52.310
SCP-3042 is a small but superpowered dog that
bonds with one individual at a time, and basically

00:09:52.310 --> 00:09:56.329
gradually loves them to death with constant
and unyielding affection.

00:09:56.329 --> 00:10:02.680
Its latest favorite person was eaten by SCP-682,
causing SCP-3042 to imprint on the monster

00:10:02.680 --> 00:10:03.910
as a replacement.

00:10:03.910 --> 00:10:09.930
However, this was disastrous, as SCP-682 immediately
attacked the tiny dog, causing it to run away

00:10:09.930 --> 00:10:11.399
in fear.

00:10:11.399 --> 00:10:16.720
SCP-3042 charged through a nearby wall - thankfully
making a hole too small for SCP-682 to escape

00:10:16.720 --> 00:10:19.490
through - and imprinted on a nearby guard.

00:10:19.490 --> 00:10:21.820
Another test failed.

00:10:21.820 --> 00:10:25.880
SCP-682 Vs SCP-407.

00:10:25.880 --> 00:10:30.199
Could the Song of Genesis alter the Hard to
Destroy Reptile out of existence, finally

00:10:30.199 --> 00:10:33.589
making it true music to the SCP Foundation’s
ears?

00:10:33.589 --> 00:10:37.730
At 25 seconds, 682 did not seem at all soothed
by the music.

00:10:37.730 --> 00:10:42.540
At 45 seconds, the creature’s wounds from
a previous test healed rapidly, and it made

00:10:42.540 --> 00:10:44.110
a high-pitched noise.

00:10:44.110 --> 00:10:50.760
At 1:25, 682 screamed, and its mouth began
to fill with a white, foamy substance.

00:10:50.760 --> 00:10:55.500
At 1:55, it swallowed this same substance
and started choking.

00:10:55.500 --> 00:11:01.380
However, at 2:35, it squired all the substance
out of its mouth in a powerful jet.

00:11:01.380 --> 00:11:08.290
And at 3:55, 682 remained unconscious for
five minutes to heal, and then awoke, utterly

00:11:08.290 --> 00:11:11.690
unaffected by the Song of Genesis.

00:11:11.690 --> 00:11:15.839
SCP-682 Vs SCP-165.

00:11:15.839 --> 00:11:19.740
Could the Hard to Destroy Reptile finally
be devoured by the combined forces of the

00:11:19.740 --> 00:11:21.820
creeping, hungry sands of tule?

00:11:21.820 --> 00:11:28.600
A large SCP-165 sample was placed beneath
a trapdoor, with 682 positioned above it.

00:11:28.600 --> 00:11:32.950
When the monster was dropped into the hill
of teeming, flesh-eating mites, they began

00:11:32.950 --> 00:11:33.950
devouring it.

00:11:33.950 --> 00:11:38.630
It was engulfed in the dune and remained in
there for ten minutes before the dune ceased

00:11:38.630 --> 00:11:43.420
activity, and a much smaller version of SCP-682
crawled out.

00:11:43.420 --> 00:11:48.490
The Fire Eaters were called in to blast both
and return 682 to its containment chamber.

00:11:48.490 --> 00:11:53.769
In all likelihood, 682 had emitted a pesticide
that killed off the mites, while a smaller

00:11:53.769 --> 00:12:00.290
version of itself hid inside its own skull
until it was safe to emerge and attempt escape.

00:12:00.290 --> 00:12:03.760
SCP-682 Vs SCP-067.

00:12:03.760 --> 00:12:08.210
While this particular cross test was never
expected to destroy or even harm the Hard

00:12:08.210 --> 00:12:12.790
to Destroy Reptile, researchers figured that
this all-telling Fountain pen might glean

00:12:12.790 --> 00:12:15.639
valuable information about the monster.

00:12:15.639 --> 00:12:20.860
SCP-067 is a pen that causes people to compulsively
write or draw about themselves.

00:12:20.860 --> 00:12:25.940
When the pen was given to SCP-682, it was
horribly surprised when it began drawing a

00:12:25.940 --> 00:12:28.060
complex image on the floor.

00:12:28.060 --> 00:12:31.230
When the image was done, it threw the pen
across the room.

00:12:31.230 --> 00:12:37.009
The resulting picture was a self-portrait
of SCP-682, sitting atop a legion of dead

00:12:37.009 --> 00:12:43.630
Roman soldiers, marked as the Ninth Legion
- which had historically, mysteriously disappeared.

00:12:43.630 --> 00:12:50.589
They may have been no closer to defeating
SCP-682, but at least they solved that mystery.

00:12:50.589 --> 00:12:57.940
scp 682 versus scp-1437 could dropping 682
in a hole to another place finally get rid

00:12:57.940 --> 00:13:06.230
of it for good to begin the test 682 was thrown
into 1437 at 1 hour 3 minutes 23 seconds scp-682

00:13:06.230 --> 00:13:11.589
was expelled from 1437 in the shape of a large
glass object filled with a red blood-like

00:13:11.589 --> 00:13:17.170
liquid an on-site bulldozer pushed it back
down the hole at 13 hours 12 minutes 7 seconds

00:13:17.170 --> 00:13:22.080
scp-682 was expelled from the hole again in
the form of a round mechanical device that

00:13:22.080 --> 00:13:26.430
released a dangerous gas and had a mouth full
of gold teeth the bulldozer pushed it back

00:13:26.430 --> 00:13:33.720
down at 27 hours 20 minutes scp-682 was propelled
out of 1437 it had returned to its original

00:13:33.720 --> 00:13:38.569
shape with the exception of a larger body
shorter snout and a variety of weapons embedded

00:13:38.569 --> 00:13:39.569
in its body

00:13:39.569 --> 00:13:43.639
SCP-682 Vs SCP-938.

00:13:43.639 --> 00:13:48.450
Can this electrical entity provide an adequate
shock to 682’s system?

00:13:48.450 --> 00:13:52.209
SCP-682 was placed in a containment chamber
attached to Site-07.

00:13:52.209 --> 00:13:56.579
An electric device was brought into the room
and routed into SCP-938.

00:13:56.579 --> 00:14:01.649
The device increased in electrical voltage
to the point that it damaged SCP-682, causing

00:14:01.649 --> 00:14:04.569
burns to its body and paralyzing it for one
hour.

00:14:04.569 --> 00:14:08.730
At this point, it regained motion capabilities
and shot electricity from its spine through

00:14:08.730 --> 00:14:09.730
its head.

00:14:09.730 --> 00:14:13.440
Then, it lost consciousness - though it was
still breathing - and remained that way for

00:14:13.440 --> 00:14:15.730
several days as its body recovered.

00:14:15.730 --> 00:14:19.259
Not quite as electrifying as the Foundation
had hoped, so it appeared.

00:14:19.259 --> 00:14:23.720
The researcher for this test, Dr. Carly, did
at least note that electrical or mind-based

00:14:23.720 --> 00:14:31.129
SCPs did tend to keep SCP-682 immobilized
longer than physical or chemical attacks.

00:14:31.129 --> 00:14:34.480
SCP-682 Vs SCP-858.

00:14:34.480 --> 00:14:38.759
Could Gravity’s Rainbow finally clear the
dark cloud of the unkillable reptile, and

00:14:38.759 --> 00:14:41.490
bring sunny skies to the SCP Foundation?

00:14:41.490 --> 00:14:47.889
A tissue sample from 682, repelled from Earth’s
gravity at a speed of 9.8 m/s was destroyed

00:14:47.889 --> 00:14:49.279
by SCP-858.

00:14:49.279 --> 00:14:55.420
When SCP-682 was exposed to 858, it began
to fall away from the Earth’s surface at

00:14:55.420 --> 00:14:57.380
the same rate as the sample.

00:14:57.380 --> 00:15:00.529
It reached 858, but it did not disappear.

00:15:00.529 --> 00:15:05.319
It hit some sort of invisible barrier, and
its body appeared to be slowly boiling.

00:15:05.319 --> 00:15:08.819
This continued until the reptile had lost
50% of its body mass.

00:15:08.819 --> 00:15:13.769
When half of its body was gone, 682 suddenly
sprouted a pair of wings similar to those

00:15:13.769 --> 00:15:18.400
of pterosaurs, in addition to an array of
air bladders that allowed it to fly perpendicular

00:15:18.400 --> 00:15:21.600
to SCP-858’s gravity.

00:15:21.600 --> 00:15:25.120
SCP-682 Vs SCP-539.

00:15:25.120 --> 00:15:29.199
Could the Perfect Distraction take 682’s
attention away from the one thing it cares

00:15:29.199 --> 00:15:30.400
about: hatred?

00:15:30.400 --> 00:15:35.449
A member of D-class personnel was sent into
SCP-682’s containment chamber, carrying

00:15:35.449 --> 00:15:36.500
SCP-539.

00:15:36.500 --> 00:15:39.290
Then, the doors were shut behind them.

00:15:39.290 --> 00:15:45.010
Terrified that SCP-682 would kill them, the
D-Class threw SCP-539 early in an attempt

00:15:45.010 --> 00:15:46.019
to distract it.

00:15:46.019 --> 00:15:51.850
As soon as SCP-539 was thrown, the site experienced
a system malfunction in the containment chamber.

00:15:51.850 --> 00:15:58.100
An acid pump was activated during this malfunction,
trapping SCP-682 for approximately 20 minutes

00:15:58.100 --> 00:16:01.009
before it was deactivated by site maintenance
staff.

00:16:01.009 --> 00:16:06.730
By the time staff reached the containment
chamber, 85% of 682’s body had been destroyed.

00:16:06.730 --> 00:16:11.000
SCP-539 was found nearby, and the D-class
was completely gone.

00:16:11.000 --> 00:16:15.850
Three hours later, SCP-682 was completely
recovered, plus an additional pair of legs

00:16:15.850 --> 00:16:17.509
grown during the healing process.

